{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Giant metal slam",
  "description": "A blast door the size of a house dropping shut in an empty hangar, heard from fairly close. First the slab falls the last metre in its guides, steel shrieking low on steel, air rushing out from under it. Then thousands of tons of plate meet the sill, not a clang but a crumbling, crowded CRASH, with the concrete floor taking the blow as a dead pitchless boom. The slab bounces and settles, two smaller, lower landings, while the plate groans as it grinds to rest in its frame and shaken-loose bolts and scale rain onto the floor. The hangar answers a beat behind with a dark roar whose low end clears first.",
  "tags": [
    "impact",
    "metal",
    "slam",
    "huge",
    "boom",
    "gate",
    "blast door",
    "hangar",
    "crash",
    "cinematic",
    "giant"
  ],
